		"name": "Movie-List",
		"description": "This movie management system provides a secure and efficient backend API for managing movies. Users can authenticate via the `/login` route to receive a JWT token, allowing them to perform CRUD operations on movies. The system supports creating movies with images, fetching paginated movie lists, updating movie details, and retrieving individual movies by their unique identifiers. Additionally, users can securely log out using the `/logout` route, ensuring a seamless and authenticated movie management experience.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "32054239"
	},
