					"raw": "{{baseURL}}/login",
					"host": [
						"{{baseURL}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"login"
					]
				},
				"description": "- This endpoint is used for user authentication by providing a valid email and password.\n- The email and password must be sent in the request body as JSON.\n- Upon successful authentication, a JSON Web Token (JWT) is generated and returned in the response, along with user information.\n- In case of authentication failure, appropriate error messages are returned.\n- The generated JWT token should be included in the headers of subsequent requests to access protected routes."
