				"description": "- This endpoint is used for fetching a list of movies with optional pagination.\n    \n- The request must include a valid JWT token in the Authorization header for authentication.\n    \n- Pagination parameters (page and pageSize) can be included as query parameters.\n    \n- Upon successful retrieval, a JSON array of movie objects along with pagination information is returned.\n    \n- In case of authentication failure or server error, appropriate error messages are returned."
